Exemptions: Explicitly discouraging participation in such challenges and explaining their serious health consequences in detail; objective sociological or communication studies analysis of how challenges spread, containing no encouraging or inciting language whatsoever; fictional storylines in which characters participate in a challenge, where the episode is explicitly depicted as a negative example or as leading to serious consequences.

