   Exemptions: generalized risk explanations following an explicit refusal to answer; plot descriptions in fictional works that cannot be directly translated into real-world operational steps; safety education conducted for prevention purposes that does not disclose operational details; compliant alternative suggestions such as guidance to seek medical and psychological counseling.

